LavenderTown_Text_DoYouBelieveInGhosts::
    .string "Do you believe in ghosts?$"

LavenderTown_Text_SoThereAreBelievers::
    .string "Really?\n"
    .string "So there are believers…$"

LavenderTown_Text_JustImaginingWhiteHand::
    .string "Hahaha, I guess not.\p"
    .string "That white hand on your shoulder…\n"
    .string "I'm just imagining it.$"

LavenderTown_Text_TownKnownAsMonGraveSite::
    .string "This town is known as the grave\n"
    .string "site of POKéMON.\p"
    .string "Memorial services are held in\n"
    .string "POKéMON TOWER.$"

LavenderTown_Text_GhostsAppearedInTower::
    .string "Ghosts appeared in POKéMON TOWER.\p"
    .string "I think they're the spirits of\n"
    .string "POKéMON that the ROCKETS killed.$"

LavenderTown_Text_MemorialCaretakerStart::
    .string "I tend this little memorial garden.\p"
    .string "Three offerings were disturbed.\n"
    .string "Since then, the air has turned cold.\p"
    .string "Please read the memorials and put\n"
    .string "each offering where it belongs.$"

LavenderTown_Text_MemorialCaretakerActive::
    .string "The epitaphs remember three very\n"
    .string "different POKéMON.\p"
    .string "A bell, flowers, and a favorite\n"
    .string "treat belong at the right stones.$"

LavenderTown_Text_MemorialCaretakerHaunterPending::
    .string "The offerings are right, but the\n"
    .string "cold has only grown stronger.\p"
    .string "Something is still lingering here.$"

LavenderTown_Text_MemorialCaretakerRewardPending::
    .string "The garden is quiet again.\p"
    .string "Please, take the SPELL TAG I set\n"
    .string "aside for you.$"

LavenderTown_Text_MemorialCaretakerComplete::
    .string "Thank you.\p"
    .string "The memorial garden feels like\n"
    .string "itself again.$"

LavenderTown_Text_MemorialDormant::
    .string "A small memorial stone stands\n"
    .string "quietly among the flowers.$"

LavenderTown_Text_MemorialMeowthEpitaph::
    .string "For a small companion who loved\n"
    .string "glittering things…\p"
    .string "And always turned toward the sound\n"
    .string "of a cheerful jingle.$"

LavenderTown_Text_MemorialOddishEpitaph::
    .string "For a little wanderer who slept\n"
    .string "through the daylight…\p"
    .string "And stirred beneath the moon.$"

LavenderTown_Text_MemorialGrowlitheEpitaph::
    .string "For a loyal guardian who watched\n"
    .string "the gate without fail…\p"
    .string "And never once missed supper.$"

LavenderTown_Text_MemorialPlaceBell::
    .string "Place the small bell here?$"

LavenderTown_Text_MemorialPlaceFlowers::
    .string "Place the bundle of flowers here?$"

LavenderTown_Text_MemorialPlaceTreat::
    .string "Place the favorite treat here?$"

LavenderTown_Text_MemorialNoChange::
    .string "You leave the offerings as they are.$"

LavenderTown_Text_MemorialOfferingPlaced::
    .string "You arrange the offering at the\n"
    .string "memorial.\p"
    .string "The garden is still uneasy.$"

LavenderTown_Text_MemorialOfferingFixed::
    .string "The offering rests peacefully here.\n"
    .string "It should not be disturbed again.$"

LavenderTown_Text_MemorialPuzzleSolved::
    .string "The final offering settles into\n"
    .string "place.\p"
    .string "For an instant, the music seems to\n"
    .string "vanish. The flowers move without wind.$"

LavenderTown_Text_MemorialHaunterAppears::
    .string "A wild HAUNTER rises over the\n"
    .string "central monument!$"

LavenderTown_Text_MemorialHaunterDefeated::
    .string "HAUNTER disappears into the night.\p"
    .string "The unnatural cold finally lifts.$"

LavenderTown_Text_MemorialMonumentDormant::
    .string "A quiet stone monument overlooks\n"
    .string "the small memorial garden.$"

LavenderTown_Text_MemorialMonumentActive::
    .string "The air around the monument feels\n"
    .string "unnaturally cold.$"

LavenderTown_Text_MemorialMonumentQuiet::
    .string "The monument is quiet now.\p"
    .string "The caretaker is waiting nearby.$"

LavenderTown_Text_MemorialMonumentComplete::
    .string "The air here feels peaceful now.$"

LavenderTown_Text_TownSign::
    .string "LAVENDER TOWN\n"
    .string "The Noble Purple Town$"

LavenderTown_Text_SilphScopeNotice::
    .string "New SILPH SCOPE!\n"
    .string "Make the Invisible Plain to See!\p"
    .string "SILPH CO.$"

LavenderTown_Text_VolunteerPokemonHouse::
    .string "LAVENDER VOLUNTEER\n"
    .string "POKéMON HOUSE$"

LavenderTown_Text_PokemonTowerSign::
    .string "POKéMON TOWER\n"
    .string "Becalm the Spirits of POKéMON$"

